# CODEOWNERS for dbk-testing
#
# Rules are evaluated last-match-wins. There is intentionally NO default
# "*" rule, so any path not matched below has no code owner and requires no
# code-owner approval.
#
# Regions:
#   - Unowned:            root-level pages and /legal  (no rule => no owner)
#   - db1342 only:        /css
#   - db1342-debug only:  /blog
#   - either owner:       /resources

# --- Only db1342 may approve/merge changes here ---
/css/ @db1342

# --- Only db1342-debug may approve/merge changes here ---
/blog/ @db1342-debug

# --- Either db1342 OR db1342-debug may approve/merge changes here ---
/resources/ @db1342 @db1342-debug

# --- Unowned (no rule): everything else ---
# Root-level pages (index.html, about.html, services.html, solutions.html,
# careers.html, contact.html) and the entire /legal directory have no code
# owner and therefore require no code-owner review.
